@baseUrl = http://localhost:5078

### Start a new job
# @name startJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs

### Images of that job
@jobId = {{startJob.response.body.$.jobId}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/images

### Status of that job
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}

### Status of invalid job
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/abv636272